
mint like
  case or, mint or
    site value
  case and, mint and
    site value
  case task, mint task
    site value
  case name
    site value

mint or
  case like, mint like
    site like
  hook make
    make or
      bind like, read like

mint and
  case like, mint like
    site like
  hook make
    make and
      bind like, read like
